Error [E0002]: This `/*` comment never gets a closing `*/`
  --> tests/ui/unterminated_block_comment.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     /* this comment is never closed
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A block comment starts with `/*` and runs until a matching `*/`
 Fix: Add a `*/` to close the comment
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0002
